{
  "description": "The creature is a stout, quadrupedal animal shown in right-facing three-quarter view standing on a small patch of bare earth with sparse green tufts and dry leaves. Its body is low and broad with a pale, transversely ridged underbelly and a dorsal surface, including the top of the head and the entire tail, covered in overlapping rounded brown-gray scales with darker centers and lighter edges. The head is broad, flat and blunt-snouted with large protruding eyes that have golden-brown irises and dark pupils, small round nostrils near the snout tip, and a straight, slightly upturned mouth. Six feathery external gills with dark stalks and dense reddish frills project from the sides of the head and neck, three per side. The limbs are thick, wrinkled and pale gray-brown, ending in splayed five-toed feet with dark claws. The tail is long, broad, flattened and paddle-shaped, tapering to a rounded tip and covered above in the same overlapping scales as the back.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad, flat and blunt-snouted with a wide mouth, small round nostrils at the tip, large protruding round eyes with golden-yellow irises, dark pupils and bluish outer rings, and pale skin with dark speckling around the eyes and snout",
      "where": "at the front of the body, facing to the right, with the top of the head covered in scales and the sides and throat pale and wrinkled"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "six external gill stalks that are dark gray-brown with dense, hair-like reddish-brown feathery filaments along their length and at the tips",
      "where": "projecting outward and upward from the sides of the head and neck, three on the left side clearly visible and three on the right side partially visible behind the head"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "overlapping rounded keratinous scales in rows, dark brown to gray with lighter edges and darker centers, largest on the mid-back and becoming smaller toward the head and tail",
      "where": "covering the entire dorsal surface from the crown of the head across the back and sides down to the belly line, and covering the entire dorsal and lateral surfaces of the tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, muscular, wrinkled limbs with pale gray-brown skin, folded at the joints and tapering to the feet",
      "where": "two forelimbs under the chest and two hindlimbs under the rear body, all supporting the body above the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "splayed feet with five short toes each tipped with dark, pointed claws, with wrinkled skin and visible toe pads",
      "where": "at the ends of each of the four legs, in contact with the ground patch"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, broad, flattened and paddle-like with a rounded tip, covered dorsally in overlapping scales matching the back and with segmented scale rows visible along its length",
      "where": "extending from the rear of the body to the left side of the image, curving slightly downward"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "small dark brown to black speckles and mottling on the pale skin of the face, and subtle darker shading within the scales",
      "where": "concentrated around the eyes, sides of the snout and throat, with the scales themselves showing tonal variation"
    }
  ],
